Convert to 12-bit two's-complement negation: invert all 12 bits, then add 1 (show inversion + final).

a) 10100101101  →  pad to 12 bits (MSBs 0): 010100101101
   Inversion:     101011010010
   Add 1:         101011010011  ← final 12-bit negation

b) 100000011  →  000100000011
   Inversion:     111011111100
   Add 1:         111011111101  ← final

c) 100100110110  (already 12 bits)
   Inversion:     011011001001
   Add 1:         011011001010  ← final

d) 101110  →  000000101110
   Inversion:     111111010001
   Add 1:         111111010010  ← final
